WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.755
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:03.025 --> 00:06.425
Junjai is the girl you've been seeing in your dreams, isn't she?

3
00:06.505 --> 00:08.345
Since I met her,

4
00:08.425 --> 00:10.785
I haven't been able to stop thinking about her.

5
00:12.905 --> 00:17.385
From now on, Junjai is Toxxxxin's fifth member.

6
00:17.985 --> 00:21.225
If you mess with her, you mess with us.

7
00:22.345 --> 00:27.545
Do I really get to be this close to you every day?

8
00:41.825 --> 00:46.945
Have you ever felt like you were half asleep and half awake?

9
00:58.385 --> 00:59.865
Go ahead and eat, Junjai.

10
01:00.705 --> 01:03.105
-I've got your breakfast ready. -Okay.

11
01:17.585 --> 01:20.425
Am I going to have to braid your hair until you're in college?

12
01:23.465 --> 01:25.305
Thanks, Auntie In.

13
01:33.585 --> 01:38.065
I'm sorry I told her you were part of our group.

14
01:39.065 --> 01:45.185
But until we're sure no one's going to bully you anymore,

15
01:45.945 --> 01:50.825
just think of yourself as the fifth member of Toxxxxin.

16
01:56.305 --> 01:57.345
Auntie In?

17
01:58.945 --> 02:05.625
If I told you I'd joined the school's most popular group,

18
02:05.705 --> 02:06.825
would you believe me?

19
02:08.385 --> 02:10.105
What kind of question is that?

20
02:10.705 --> 02:12.385
Of course I would.

21
02:12.465 --> 02:15.025
My niece is gorgeous.

22
02:15.105 --> 02:17.065
You've got an amazing figure.

23
02:19.025 --> 02:21.065
What's so gorgeous about me?

24
02:21.145 --> 02:22.945
You're the only one who ever says that.

25
02:23.025 --> 02:28.425
Suddenly, I feel like I'm waking up, yet somehow still dreaming.

26
02:30.745 --> 02:33.745
No matter how hard I try to live my life as usual,

27
02:35.105 --> 02:38.545
sometimes, what's in front of me feels strangely unreal.

28
02:51.065 --> 02:55.065
And sometimes, it feels so real it scares me.

29
02:55.785 --> 02:59.465
Full team! Took you long enough, kiddo.

30
02:59.545 --> 03:01.745
We've got so much to talk about.

31
03:01.825 --> 03:03.785
Let's hurry back to our room.

32
03:03.865 --> 03:05.185
Huh?

33
03:06.145 --> 03:07.345
Why so confused?

34
03:08.545 --> 03:12.225
We promised, remember?

35
03:14.785 --> 03:16.545
Are you going to wait until school's over?

36
03:16.625 --> 03:18.465
Come on, let's go!

37
03:20.905 --> 03:24.145
If all of this really is just a dream,

38
03:24.985 --> 03:30.225
then I'll make the most of this short dream!

39
04:00.265 --> 04:03.825
Okay, we don't have much time before the bell,

40
04:03.905 --> 04:06.225
so let's get straight to it.

41
04:06.305 --> 04:10.705
We've already come up with a plan to stop you from getting bullied.

42
04:10.785 --> 04:14.145
Do you know the first thing you need?

43
04:16.265 --> 04:17.585
It's…?

44
04:18.785 --> 04:19.825
It's…?

45
04:20.825 --> 04:22.064
A self-defense weapon?

46
04:24.065 --> 04:26.305
I mean, she's not wrong.

47
04:26.905 --> 04:27.945
Beauty, dear.

48
04:28.945 --> 04:33.745
You need to feel confident, and looking good is the easiest way to get there.

49
04:33.825 --> 04:39.305
So your clothes, your hair, your makeup, and this whole look of yours

50
04:40.025 --> 04:42.825
are getting a complete makeover.

51
04:42.905 --> 04:45.385
Hey, I'll start with her nails today.

52
04:45.465 --> 04:46.905
Just enough, not too much.

53
04:48.305 --> 04:51.265
But wouldn't that break school rules?

54
05:00.025 --> 05:01.465
We'll deal with that later.

55
05:01.545 --> 05:03.345
We've got our ways.

56
05:03.425 --> 05:05.785
You should've told her first.

57
05:05.865 --> 05:07.385
You scared her. See?

58
05:08.345 --> 05:10.985
Go on. Help with her hair.

59
05:11.745 --> 05:13.625
What color should we use?

60
05:15.025 --> 05:20.425
You guys are nothing like I imagined.

61
05:21.825 --> 05:22.785
How so?

62
05:24.585 --> 05:29.465
I thought you kept to yourselves,

63
05:30.585 --> 05:34.625
didn't hang out with anyone, and seemed cold.

64
05:34.705 --> 05:37.585
But actually,

65
05:39.065 --> 05:42.745
you're really sweet and so down-to-earth.

66
05:46.025 --> 05:49.105
Aww, you are so cute.

67
05:50.065 --> 05:51.825
You're so adorable.

68
05:51.905 --> 05:53.505
Can I keep her at home?

69
05:53.585 --> 05:56.465
Hey, stop talking nonsense. We're running out of time.

70
05:58.665 --> 06:00.545
-Shit, you're right. -Shit.

71
06:00.625 --> 06:02.985
Let me take your measurements first, okay?

72
06:05.225 --> 06:07.545
I'll leave this to you.

73
06:09.185 --> 06:10.425
What?

74
06:10.505 --> 06:12.065
We're busy over here.

75
06:12.145 --> 06:13.065
Go.

76
06:13.145 --> 06:13.985
Be careful.

77
06:14.065 --> 06:16.145
Nails!

78
06:38.785 --> 06:40.345
Why are you covering your face?

79
06:46.465 --> 06:48.985
Well, I don't really like my face.

80
06:55.305 --> 06:59.185
If you don't like it, who will?

81
07:06.425 --> 07:10.505
The important thing is learning to love yourself first.

82
07:11.345 --> 07:12.225
You know that?

83
07:13.985 --> 07:16.865
You're so pretty,

84
07:18.585 --> 07:20.025
and you've got a great figure.

85
07:24.265 --> 07:28.825
You know, you sound just like my aunt.

86
07:31.105 --> 07:32.105
What?

87
07:32.745 --> 07:34.065
Are you saying I'm old?

88
07:35.065 --> 07:37.585
No! I meant…

89
07:37.665 --> 07:39.785
-I didn't mean it like that. -Then what did you mean?

90
07:39.865 --> 07:41.585
-Nothing like that. -So what did you mean?

91
07:41.665 --> 07:46.585
Well, I just meant…

92
07:46.665 --> 07:48.065
Hey, we've got three minutes left.

93
07:49.345 --> 07:52.505
You're so good at ruining the mood!

94
07:52.585 --> 07:55.825
Come on, sweetie. Let's finish getting you dressed. Come on.

95
07:55.905 --> 07:57.145
Your nails.

96
08:05.585 --> 08:08.185
Gale, come help me iron this.

97
09:01.825 --> 09:05.225
WE'VE CHANGED YOUR DESK.

98
09:11.505 --> 09:13.945
Junjai, what did you do?

99
09:14.025 --> 09:15.545
Your hairstyle is insanely amazing.

100
09:18.345 --> 09:19.785
Thanks.

101
09:19.865 --> 09:22.105
I look weird, don't I?

102
09:22.185 --> 09:25.185
Weird? You look like an Asian supermodel.

103
09:25.265 --> 09:27.865
Don't tell me the Toxxxxin girls gave you a makeover!?

104
09:27.945 --> 09:30.785
Tell us about it!

105
09:30.865 --> 09:32.185
IS SHE A NEW STUDENT???

106
09:33.665 --> 09:35.705
-#WHAT DID JJ DO? -YES???

107
09:35.785 --> 09:37.385
-TOXXXXXIN'S FIFTH MEMBER -SHE'S FABBIE.

108
09:37.465 --> 09:39.785
-I ALMOST COULDN'T RECOGNIZE HER. -FROM ZERO TO SUPERSTAR.

109
09:40.865 --> 09:43.425
Guys, our little puppy is getting complimented!

110
09:44.145 --> 09:46.545
Her beauty aura is on its way.

111
09:48.345 --> 09:49.305
Look.

112
09:59.385 --> 10:00.505
Maybe not yet.

113
10:04.945 --> 10:06.105
Should we go for it now?

114
10:08.545 --> 10:10.105
Let's do it.

115
10:10.185 --> 10:13.305
Okay, the next step is

116
10:13.385 --> 10:15.745
to change how you present yourself online.

117
10:15.825 --> 10:18.025
Start a new account and make it private.

118
10:18.105 --> 10:21.105
Pretty, poised, and a little mysterious.

119
10:21.945 --> 10:23.985
You don't have to force it, though.

120
10:24.065 --> 10:27.265
Just be yourself. That's the best thing you can do.

121
10:28.545 --> 10:33.025
But if I act the same, won't everything stay the same?

122
10:33.105 --> 10:34.425
No.

123
10:34.985 --> 10:39.785
You get bullied because people see you as beneath them.

124
10:40.705 --> 10:42.385
It's like they've stuck a label on you.

125
10:42.465 --> 10:44.225
We're just peeling it off.

126
10:44.305 --> 10:47.665
If you're still uncomfortable,

127
10:49.465 --> 10:51.145
you can play a little hard to get.

128
10:54.825 --> 10:57.545
And that wraps up phase one.

129
10:58.385 --> 10:59.825
What a shame, though.

130
10:59.905 --> 11:03.025
I wish we could give her a fabulous debut.

131
11:03.105 --> 11:04.945
Like a grand opening!

132
11:05.025 --> 11:08.345
Don't. If we force it, it'll look like we're trying too hard.

133
11:09.345 --> 11:11.745
See you in class. I'm going up for a nap.

134
11:12.785 --> 11:15.745
Come on. You've barely helped since she got here.

135
11:15.825 --> 11:17.425
This isn't my thing.

136
11:17.505 --> 11:19.105
Do whatever you want.

137
11:27.985 --> 11:28.865
Gale.

138
11:28.945 --> 11:32.385
We need to make a poster to promote Sports Day.

139
11:32.465 --> 11:35.545
We were hoping an athlete could model for us.

140
11:36.825 --> 11:38.425
Ask someone else.

141
11:38.505 --> 11:41.545
I don't think I'm the right fit.

142
11:41.625 --> 11:44.865
Aww, but you're the perfect choice when it comes to sports.

143
11:44.945 --> 11:46.505
You're also gorgeous.

144
11:46.585 --> 11:49.865
If you modeled for us, the poster would look amazing.

145
11:49.945 --> 11:52.825
-Please? -Please, please, please?

146
11:55.185 --> 11:59.305
ACTUALLY, JUNJAI HAS THE LOOK OF A MODEL.

147
11:59.385 --> 12:01.665
-Please, Gale. -Just follow my lead.

148
12:01.745 --> 12:02.785
Let's put it this way.

149
12:02.865 --> 12:05.225
She might be shy to shoot alone.

150
12:05.305 --> 12:07.505
We'll help.

151
12:08.025 --> 12:14.145
But can we tweak the concept a little?

152
12:23.665 --> 12:24.705
Uncle Jes!

153
12:26.745 --> 12:28.265
Do you have any outfits we could borrow?!

154
12:29.425 --> 12:30.465
What?!

155
12:47.065 --> 12:49.305
That's fab. So professional!

156
12:49.385 --> 12:52.145
This is right up your alley, huh?

157
12:52.225 --> 12:53.545
You guys owe me a meal.

158
12:54.305 --> 12:56.865
Okay, next up are the pair shots.

159
12:56.945 --> 12:59.185
Hey, does this look okay?

160
13:04.105 --> 13:06.385
Yeah. Go for it!

161
13:07.385 --> 13:10.505
Gale, help her out, please.

162
13:13.065 --> 13:14.785
Okay, pose, please.

163
13:18.825 --> 13:20.865
Stunning. Keep going.

164
13:22.865 --> 13:24.625
Gorgeous.

165
13:28.705 --> 13:30.145
When you hold a racket,

166
13:31.025 --> 13:32.425
put this hand here.

167
13:33.665 --> 13:35.305
Then support it with this hand.

168
13:42.665 --> 13:43.505
Thank you.

169
13:43.585 --> 13:45.265
Let's get this over with

170
13:45.905 --> 13:47.265
so I can leave already.

171
13:48.225 --> 13:49.705
Keep posing.

172
13:50.625 --> 13:52.145
Should we ship them?

173
13:52.225 --> 13:53.105
Stop!

174
13:55.585 --> 13:56.905
Still, this is nice.

175
13:57.665 --> 14:01.225
Now that's more like a grand opening.

176
14:06.345 --> 14:07.665
-SLAY!!! -ROGER THAT!

177
14:08.665 --> 14:11.425
-GAY PANIC! GALE'S SUPER FABULOUS. -JUNJAI'S POSTER IS FAB TOO.

178
14:11.505 --> 14:12.625
YOUR BEST ENERGY!

179
14:12.705 --> 14:13.745
YEAH. SHE SLAYS.

180
14:13.825 --> 14:14.785
I'M DYING.

181
14:14.865 --> 14:16.625
-I SHIP THEM. -JJ = JUST JAW-DROPPING!

182
14:16.705 --> 14:17.825
-THE CHEMISTRY! -THAT SLAPS!

183
14:49.905 --> 14:53.465
Something like this takes time, you know?

184
14:53.545 --> 14:55.065
So just don't care.

185
15:00.705 --> 15:03.385
There's one last thing you need to do.

186
15:03.465 --> 15:04.705
This one's going to be tough.

187
15:04.785 --> 15:06.305
You'll have to do it on your own.

188
15:18.545 --> 15:21.065
As a math scholarship student,

189
15:21.145 --> 15:23.545
you must know about next week's Athena Mathematics competition.

190
15:23.625 --> 15:26.345
Our school is hosting this year.

191
15:26.425 --> 15:28.225
Students from other schools will be coming here.

192
15:29.145 --> 15:30.785
If you win a gold medal,

193
15:30.865 --> 15:33.025
your standing here will change overnight.

194
15:34.145 --> 15:35.385
You've got the looks.

195
15:35.465 --> 15:36.985
Now you just need to prove your brains.

196
15:37.065 --> 15:40.985
Once you bring the school some glory, everything will get much easier.

197
15:42.105 --> 15:46.945
But I've never entered a competition this big before.

198
15:47.025 --> 15:48.185
You can do it.

199
15:48.265 --> 15:49.825
Believe in yourself.

200
15:54.225 --> 15:56.945
Okay. I'll give it a try.

201
15:57.985 --> 15:58.865
Good.

202
15:58.945 --> 16:01.665
Leave the application paperwork to us. We'll take care of it.

203
16:01.745 --> 16:05.145
Here are the papers from previous years.

204
16:05.225 --> 16:07.465
We got them from the documents room.

205
16:07.545 --> 16:08.705
Don't let these get out.

206
16:09.425 --> 16:12.065
But aren't students banned from going in there?

207
16:13.105 --> 16:14.345
They can't stop Gale.

208
16:19.465 --> 16:20.385
But don't worry.

209
16:21.065 --> 16:22.945
We only took papers from previous years.

210
16:23.025 --> 16:24.665
Our school's so weird.

211
16:24.745 --> 16:26.505
Other schools let students look at past papers.

212
16:26.585 --> 16:28.385
Why keep them under wraps?

213
16:28.465 --> 16:31.265
This year's papers are in there too, right?

214
16:31.345 --> 16:35.265
Hey, taking those would be cheating.

215
16:40.225 --> 16:43.105
Okay, I've got other things to do.

216
16:43.705 --> 16:45.265
I need to take the sulky girl to lunch.

217
16:46.985 --> 16:48.865
I'll go get your things, then.

218
16:49.945 --> 16:52.345
I'll leave her to you, Tutor Chelsea.

219
16:52.425 --> 16:53.625
You can do it!

220
17:01.345 --> 17:02.505
Pretty cool, huh?

221
17:04.385 --> 17:05.905
In a weird way, though.

222
17:09.704 --> 17:11.184
The more I get to know you,

223
17:11.265 --> 17:14.305
the more amazing I think you all are.

224
17:14.985 --> 17:16.385
You're all so cool.

225
17:17.985 --> 17:19.305
It feels like a dream.

226
17:20.424 --> 17:21.424
What dream?

227
17:22.704 --> 17:23.665
Seriously.

228
17:24.944 --> 17:26.625
I still don't understand

229
17:27.305 --> 17:30.265
why you're helping someone like me.

230
17:31.665 --> 17:32.985
That's a secret.

231
17:43.145 --> 17:44.185
Let me put it this way.

232
17:44.865 --> 17:49.705
Actually, we're all different in lots of ways,

233
17:50.385 --> 17:52.545
like why we keep our accounts private.

234
17:53.545 --> 17:55.665
Do you want to know why?

235
18:06.505 --> 18:07.985
Do you know this actress?

236
18:09.825 --> 18:11.465
Oh, I've seen her.

237
18:11.545 --> 18:12.945
She used to play leading roles,

238
18:13.025 --> 18:15.425
then started a page when she had a kid, right?

239
18:15.505 --> 18:17.305
She was really popular for a while.

240
18:17.385 --> 18:19.185
Her kid was so cute.

241
18:20.705 --> 18:22.625
That's my mom.

242
18:26.345 --> 18:29.945
She's been trying to make me famous since I was little.

243
18:30.025 --> 18:32.025
Everything in my life was work.

244
18:32.105 --> 18:33.185
Everything was for show.

245
18:33.265 --> 18:34.505
Footprints were everywhere.

246
18:35.105 --> 18:36.505
I got so sick of it.

247
18:37.185 --> 18:39.185
Eventually, I had to talk it out with her.

248
18:39.265 --> 18:41.665
I told her I wanted to stop. I needed a detox.

249
18:41.745 --> 18:43.225
Seriously?

250
18:44.985 --> 18:46.305
As for Meimei…

251
18:47.465 --> 18:48.665
Nothing much.

252
18:48.745 --> 18:51.465
Her family's just a typical rich family. They run a used-car dealership.

253
18:51.545 --> 18:56.505
The problem is, her family's taste is kind of embarrassing.

254
18:56.585 --> 18:59.585
Meimei always says her family doesn't just deal in cars.

255
18:59.665 --> 19:01.185
They deal in embarrassment too.

256
19:02.905 --> 19:04.185
As for Gale,

257
19:05.505 --> 19:08.025
she's really gifted at arts,

258
19:08.105 --> 19:11.185
but she comes from a family of doctors,

259
19:11.265 --> 19:12.985
so they aren't too keen on it.

260
19:13.065 --> 19:14.825
She started pushing back.

261
19:14.905 --> 19:16.825
Things are better now, though.

262
19:16.905 --> 19:18.785
Her family's starting to accept it.

263
19:21.825 --> 19:24.385
That's why we stay off social media.

264
19:24.985 --> 19:25.985
Nothing dramatic.

265
19:27.105 --> 19:30.865
We've all just got our own silly reasons.

266
19:34.305 --> 19:35.145
How about…?

267
19:35.225 --> 19:39.345
But Aidao is different.

268
19:43.305 --> 19:46.265
Her dad's a famous politician.

269
19:46.345 --> 19:47.865
Ouch.

270
19:49.385 --> 19:50.585
With a perfect public image.

271
19:51.665 --> 19:53.625
But at the same time,

272
19:53.705 --> 19:57.105
he's also a high-ranking military officer who raises his children with an iron fist.

273
19:58.985 --> 20:00.545
Whenever they make a mistake,

274
20:00.625 --> 20:01.985
the result is violence.

275
20:03.505 --> 20:04.905
To us,

276
20:04.985 --> 20:08.385
Aidao's life is like a cage.

277
20:09.705 --> 20:14.545
And we hope so damn much that one day she'll break free.

278
20:16.905 --> 20:20.785
Why are you telling me all this?

279
20:22.345 --> 20:24.385
That's because, honestly,

280
20:25.465 --> 20:27.025
Aidao wants to help you.

281
20:28.305 --> 20:30.865
But we want to help Aidao.

282
20:34.265 --> 20:38.585
And our intuition tells us that if we keep helping you,

283
20:39.505 --> 20:42.345
something will change someday.

284
20:44.585 --> 20:46.305
Don't underestimate our intuition.

285
20:46.385 --> 20:47.745
It's pretty powerful.

286
20:48.905 --> 20:51.385
So make sure you really thank Aidao.

287
20:51.985 --> 20:53.625
Her own life's hard enough,

288
20:53.705 --> 20:55.105
but she still wants to help you.

289
20:55.665 --> 20:56.505
Look.

290
20:56.585 --> 20:59.345
She put together all these casual outfits for you,

291
20:59.425 --> 21:01.305
so you can look good on other days too.

292
21:01.945 --> 21:04.825
And these are tons of skincare products.

293
21:04.905 --> 21:06.145
Make sure you use them.

294
21:15.265 --> 21:19.065
DON'T FORGET TO LIKE YOURSELF TOO.

295
21:23.305 --> 21:24.905
Keep fighting, Junjai.

296
21:24.985 --> 21:26.945
Aidao's really rooting for you.

297
21:29.785 --> 21:32.705
Okay, let's start studying.

298
21:32.785 --> 21:34.225
We've spent way too long gossiping.

299
21:34.305 --> 21:35.985
-Come on. -Put it away already.

300
21:37.105 --> 21:38.185
Thank you.

301
21:38.265 --> 21:39.265
This one, okay?

302
21:39.865 --> 21:41.305
This one.

303
22:37.465 --> 22:40.705
DON'T FORGET TO LIKE YOURSELF TOO.

304
22:48.265 --> 22:51.745
CUZ I'M STARTING TO TOO.

305
23:12.025 --> 23:15.705
HOW TO LOOK BEAUTIFUL FROM MORNING TILL BEDTIME

306
24:14.305 --> 24:17.185
LAUNDRY

307
24:36.025 --> 24:38.505
Come here. Your hair's getting in your food.

308
24:41.345 --> 24:42.305
Well…

309
24:42.385 --> 24:43.465
But you know,

310
24:43.985 --> 24:47.705
I love braiding your hair, Junjai.

311
24:49.625 --> 24:51.985
Your hair looks beautiful.

312
24:52.065 --> 24:54.145
Braids really suit you.

313
25:04.585 --> 25:07.065
YOU DON'T BELONG IN TOXXXXIN!

314
25:13.665 --> 25:14.625
Gotcha.

315
25:14.705 --> 25:17.785
You act like you don't care, but you're worried about her, right?

316
25:18.905 --> 25:21.785
I just wanted to check how she's doing.

317
25:21.865 --> 25:23.665
Sure. Playing it cool, huh?

318
25:24.305 --> 25:27.465
You've actually opened up to her. I can tell.

319
25:27.545 --> 25:31.985
Honestly, I haven't.

320
25:33.945 --> 25:35.745
We've only known her for a few days.

321
25:36.465 --> 25:39.945
Isn't it too soon to trust her?

322
25:41.225 --> 25:44.345
Aren't you putting up too many walls this time?

323
25:45.065 --> 25:46.585
I'm not putting up walls.

324
25:46.665 --> 25:49.545
You guys realize

325
25:50.385 --> 25:53.385
just how hard you're pushing her by doing this, right?

326
26:05.065 --> 26:07.185
I SAW TOXXXXIN'S FIFTH MEMBER.

327
26:14.105 --> 26:16.985
BUS STOP

328
26:40.425 --> 26:41.385
Junjai!

329
26:44.105 --> 26:45.345
Where are you rushing off to?

330
26:47.505 --> 26:48.985
Do you guys need something?

331
26:49.065 --> 26:51.585
You've been looking so pretty lately.

332
26:51.665 --> 26:55.025
Could we get a picture with you?

333
26:55.665 --> 26:58.425
Please? Just one picture!

334
26:58.505 --> 26:59.465
A group shot will do.

335
26:59.545 --> 27:01.465
-Please. -Could we get a picture with you?

336
27:02.305 --> 27:03.665
Just one would be enough.

337
27:03.745 --> 27:04.665
What are you doing here?

338
27:06.065 --> 27:07.705
Shouldn't you be getting ready for class?

339
27:08.705 --> 27:11.425
Year 10 has to go to the auditorium today.

340
27:11.505 --> 27:12.385
Remember?

341
27:13.025 --> 27:14.945
Well… yes, miss.

342
27:25.305 --> 27:26.705
I brought you these documents.

343
27:27.985 --> 27:30.505
You passed the ATHENA qualifying round.

344
27:30.585 --> 27:34.825
These are the final documents and all the rules and regulations.

345
27:34.905 --> 27:37.025
Make sure you read everything.

346
27:37.105 --> 27:38.825
Thank you, miss.

347
27:40.545 --> 27:41.945
Congratulations.

348
27:42.945 --> 27:47.385
Your hard work and perseverance has paid off.

349
27:49.905 --> 27:51.865
You noticed, miss?

350
27:52.985 --> 27:54.345
I noticed everything.

351
28:00.905 --> 28:02.945
By the way, are you free right now?

352
28:03.025 --> 28:04.625
There's something I'd like to show you.

353
28:16.705 --> 28:18.025
What do you see?

354
28:20.025 --> 28:23.585
Lots of awards.

355
28:23.665 --> 28:26.745
For academics and other things.

356
28:27.345 --> 28:30.865
Our school has so many talented students.

357
28:31.545 --> 28:33.385
And…

358
28:33.465 --> 28:37.545
Some of these belong to Toxxxxin too.

359
28:37.625 --> 28:38.545
Here.

360
28:41.105 --> 28:42.265
You're right.

361
28:43.825 --> 28:47.225
But why are you showing me this?

362
28:54.665 --> 28:56.025
-NASTY BITCH! -SO PRETENTIOUS!

363
28:56.105 --> 28:57.345
-CAN'T STAND HER FACE! -SO FAKE!

364
28:59.585 --> 29:02.025
I don't know who did it.

365
29:02.945 --> 29:07.345
Maybe whoever did it had no serious reason at all.

366
29:08.985 --> 29:10.105
It's senseless, right?

367
29:14.985 --> 29:16.985
What I'm trying to say is,

368
29:17.945 --> 29:23.265
not everyone loves and worships Toxxxxin, you know.

369
29:25.665 --> 29:27.825
The longer you stay with that group,

370
29:28.545 --> 29:33.785
the more likely you are to face the same thing, Junjai.

371
29:35.785 --> 29:38.905
We agreed that once we'd helped her,

372
29:38.985 --> 29:41.345
we'd go our separate ways.

373
29:41.425 --> 29:42.945
If that's all we're doing, I'm on board.

374
29:43.745 --> 29:45.905
But she won't be able to take staying in Toxxxxin forever.

375
29:45.985 --> 29:48.345
Maybe she will be able to handle it though.

376
29:49.065 --> 29:50.345
We can, right?

377
29:51.145 --> 29:53.225
Junjai isn't like us.

378
29:54.305 --> 29:56.465
Her family background alone is different.

379
29:57.105 --> 29:59.225
Things are bound to get rough. You all know that.

380
29:59.905 --> 30:03.025
From the students and the teachers too.

381
30:03.105 --> 30:05.745
The teachers are even worse.

382
30:06.505 --> 30:07.665
Look.

383
30:07.745 --> 30:12.025
Even though Toxxxxin has done so much to bring honor to the school,

384
30:13.505 --> 30:18.505
there's no mention of them at all in the Hall of Fame.

385
30:20.865 --> 30:22.945
Why would they do that?

386
30:25.025 --> 30:26.505
Because, at the end of the day,

387
30:27.505 --> 30:32.265
this school still sees Toxxxxin as nothing but troublemakers.

388
30:35.705 --> 30:36.945
It hurts, doesn't it?

389
30:37.905 --> 30:41.425
Sometimes, adults behave worse than kids.

390
30:43.105 --> 30:44.465
What do you want us to do, then?

391
30:44.545 --> 30:47.065
Just let Junjai go like this?

392
30:47.145 --> 30:50.705
Hey, we've already helped her.

393
30:50.785 --> 30:53.185
Her life's better now.

394
30:53.265 --> 30:57.665
Shouldn't we let her decide for herself

395
30:59.065 --> 31:01.465
whether she wants to stay in Toxxxxin?

396
31:04.105 --> 31:10.025
I'm glad to see you've been changing for the better.

397
31:11.865 --> 31:15.225
But it seems you'll soon have to decide.

398
31:16.865 --> 31:20.825
Will you be a troublemaker in the teachers' eyes?

399
31:21.905 --> 31:24.065
Or will you find where you belong

400
31:25.545 --> 31:27.665
and be a good student at school?

401
32:07.105 --> 32:07.985
Yes?

402
32:08.065 --> 32:09.865
Breakfast's ready, sweetie.

403
32:09.945 --> 32:12.305
Eh? Isn't it Saturday today?

404
32:12.905 --> 32:15.425
I have an exam at school.

405
32:16.345 --> 32:18.465
Then let me braid your hair like always.

406
32:25.105 --> 32:26.185
Auntie In?

407
32:27.585 --> 32:31.225
If I became a bad kid one day,

408
32:32.265 --> 32:34.065
will you scold me?

409
32:36.625 --> 32:37.705
Bad? How?

410
32:40.465 --> 32:45.825
Say I broke the dress code

411
32:46.665 --> 32:48.025
or tried to stand out.

412
32:50.185 --> 32:51.025
That's all?

413
32:52.105 --> 32:54.985
But I don't feel that those things are bad.

414
33:01.665 --> 33:05.065
I don't know what you've been through.

415
33:06.385 --> 33:07.745
But I believe

416
33:07.825 --> 33:11.105
we've raised you to be a good person.

417
33:13.785 --> 33:16.025
Trust your feelings.

418
33:16.105 --> 33:17.785
Don't worry about what others think.

419
33:17.865 --> 33:19.025
Understand?

420
33:49.465 --> 33:50.425
What's wrong?

421
34:14.425 --> 34:17.344
Hey, the exam's about to start.

422
34:17.425 --> 34:18.625
Let's go cheer her on.

423
34:22.304 --> 34:23.304
Hurry up.

424
34:30.344 --> 34:34.625
Please proceed to the examination room.

425
34:40.945 --> 34:41.985
Where's Junjai?

426
34:42.065 --> 34:44.145
Don't tell me she overslept.

427
34:45.425 --> 34:48.185
Nonsense. Who'd mess up like that?

428
34:48.264 --> 34:51.905
You, Gale. Last month, you were so busy spray-painting walls, you forgot our plan.

429
34:51.985 --> 34:52.905
I remember!

430
34:52.985 --> 34:54.304
It was one time.

431
34:54.385 --> 34:55.865
How do you remember that so well?

432
34:56.585 --> 34:57.625
She's not replying.

433
34:57.705 --> 34:59.105
She's not picking up either.

434
35:00.505 --> 35:02.025
Or did she really oversleep?

435
35:03.425 --> 35:04.585
I don't know.

436
35:04.665 --> 35:07.945
Maybe she doesn't want to come anymore.

437
35:12.145 --> 35:13.225
Who's that?

438
35:15.425 --> 35:17.105
Is she a celebrity or something?

439
35:57.585 --> 35:59.425
Did you call and coach her beforehand?

440
36:00.545 --> 36:01.505
She nailed it!

441
36:01.585 --> 36:03.265
Yes, girl! That's my baby!

442
36:09.425 --> 36:10.585
-GORGEOUS! -SHE WORE THAT?!

443
36:13.385 --> 36:14.665
WHAT A QUEEN! WHO'S THAT IN RED?

444
36:36.865 --> 36:39.105
Okay, now that's too much.

445
36:39.185 --> 36:40.465
I almost got a heart attack.

446
36:46.105 --> 36:48.585
Student, today's the exam.

447
36:49.145 --> 36:51.425
How could you show up dressed like this?

448
36:51.505 --> 36:52.785
Why not, miss?

449
36:53.585 --> 36:57.505
There's no rule saying we have to wear our uniforms today.

450
37:00.305 --> 37:01.545
Check the rules.

451
37:02.305 --> 37:05.425
Miss, you can read them as many times as you like,

452
37:06.345 --> 37:10.225
but I've already read all 36 rules carefully.

453
37:11.305 --> 37:15.465
None of them say we can't wear our own clothes to the exam today.

454
37:17.065 --> 37:23.425
I'm confident I can make our school proud

455
37:23.505 --> 37:26.385
while still being myself.

456
37:30.145 --> 37:32.025
Please let me take the exam.

457
37:32.105 --> 37:35.625
I'll beat everyone in uniform.

458
37:47.265 --> 37:48.225
Thank you.

459
37:53.745 --> 37:57.625
Excuse me. Can I borrow her for a second?

460
37:57.705 --> 37:59.985
Wait, wait. Wait, wait, wait, wait!

461
38:02.625 --> 38:03.865
Wait, wait, wait!

462
38:04.545 --> 38:06.705
What? What is it?

463
38:06.785 --> 38:09.945
Hey, what made you dress like this?

464
38:12.585 --> 38:16.185
Why? Does it look bad?

465
38:18.345 --> 38:19.745
You look so damn good.

466
38:19.825 --> 38:21.185
Too good!

467
38:21.265 --> 38:23.185
You really surprised me, you know?

468
38:23.785 --> 38:25.985
Everything looks amazing.

469
38:34.305 --> 38:38.385
Well, I should thank whoever picked this outfit for me.

470
38:39.425 --> 38:40.865
She's got quite an eye.

471
38:43.785 --> 38:45.105
Of course.

472
38:45.185 --> 38:47.385
That stylist is cool as hell.

473
38:51.825 --> 38:53.305
You're making me a little shy.

474
38:54.265 --> 38:57.305
What? About the outfit?

475
38:57.385 --> 39:01.305
Don't be. You'll get used to it if you wear it more.

476
39:01.385 --> 39:02.825
It's not the outfit.

477
39:05.945 --> 39:07.305
You're making me shy.

478
39:14.025 --> 39:15.785
Can you compliment me some more?

479
39:17.505 --> 39:18.385
That's enough.

480
39:18.465 --> 39:20.105
I won't.

481
39:21.065 --> 39:25.225
Come on. Just a little more?

482
39:25.305 --> 39:26.905
Please?

483
39:29.345 --> 39:30.625
What?

484
39:30.705 --> 39:34.625
Please. Just a little more, okay?

485
39:34.705 --> 39:35.865
What?

486
39:36.385 --> 39:38.705
Your hair looks great.

487
39:38.785 --> 39:40.065
So does your face.

488
39:40.585 --> 39:42.865
You did your makeup exactly how I taught you.

489
39:45.865 --> 39:49.945
But actually, with this outfit,

490
39:50.025 --> 39:53.065
a slightly darker lip would make it perfect.

491
39:54.585 --> 39:55.545
Hold on.

492
40:53.425 --> 40:55.145
Make the gold medal yours.

493
41:01.425 --> 41:02.705
Yep.

494
41:11.105 --> 41:12.225
So what now?

495
41:16.025 --> 41:18.705
Well, I think…

496
41:21.145 --> 41:22.625
I'm totally falling for her.

497
41:29.145 --> 41:32.665
And you may begin the exam.

498
41:32.745 --> 41:36.945
Use a 2B pencil for the exam and refrain from using…

499
41:45.945 --> 41:47.745
JUNJAI JANYAKUL SAINT CECILIA SCHOOL

500
41:52.145 --> 41:53.985
-JUNJAI, YOU ROCK! YOU SLAYED! -A TRUE TOXXXXIN!

501
41:54.065 --> 41:55.025
YOU SLAYED, JUNJAI!

502
41:55.105 --> 41:57.825
Why did you choose this outfit? Don't you think it breaks the rules?

503
41:58.425 --> 42:00.305
I read the rules carefully.

504
42:00.385 --> 42:03.265
None of them ban casual clothes,

505
42:04.105 --> 42:07.065
so I wanted to wear something that made me feel good about myself.

506
42:07.145 --> 42:11.065
Don't you think standing out like this could cause problems for you?

507
42:11.145 --> 42:12.145
Not at all.

508
42:12.225 --> 42:13.865
Just look at all of you.

509
42:13.945 --> 42:17.305
You're all wearing what you like, right?

510
42:17.385 --> 42:21.465
The more we like ourselves, the more confident we become,

511
42:21.545 --> 42:23.945
and that makes us happier at work.

512
42:24.025 --> 42:25.265
Do you agree?

513
42:35.225 --> 42:37.385
Cheers!

514
42:37.465 --> 42:39.345
Congratulations again, Junjai.

515
42:39.425 --> 42:41.145
You were so damn cool today.

516
42:41.225 --> 42:42.465
Seriously!

517
42:42.545 --> 42:45.545
One word: slay!

518
42:46.785 --> 42:49.105
It's thanks to your help too.

519
42:49.185 --> 42:52.665
There you go being modest again. We only helped you study a little.

520
42:52.745 --> 42:56.785
I mean everything you've done for me.

521
42:58.105 --> 42:59.865
You encouraged me

522
43:01.185 --> 43:02.905
and gave me role models to look up to.

523
43:03.705 --> 43:08.345
I'm so glad I met you all.

524
43:10.385 --> 43:11.425
Thank you.

525
43:11.505 --> 43:14.665
Aww! You're making us blush.

526
43:14.745 --> 43:16.905
Stop giving us those puppy-dog eyes. You little puppy!

527
43:16.985 --> 43:18.385
Go on! Go fetch!

528
43:20.025 --> 43:23.265
Aw! So cute.

529
43:30.905 --> 43:31.945
And what about you?

530
43:32.545 --> 43:34.825
Have you warmed up to her yet?

531
43:35.825 --> 43:37.025
What are you talking about?

532
43:37.785 --> 43:39.145
“What are you talking about?”

533
43:39.225 --> 43:40.545
Leave her alone.

534
43:40.625 --> 43:42.505
She'll open up in her own time.

535
43:45.465 --> 43:46.465
Look over here instead.

536
43:46.545 --> 43:49.065
This one's opened her heart wide.

537
43:49.145 --> 43:50.065
Exactly.

538
43:50.985 --> 43:53.505
And you? Babe!

539
43:53.585 --> 43:55.385
-Have you opened your heart to me? -What?!

540
43:55.465 --> 43:56.745
Mei, you're mental, huh?!

541
43:56.825 --> 43:57.945
-Stay away from me! -Babe!

542
43:58.025 --> 43:59.465
Gale, help me!

543
43:59.545 --> 44:01.825
-Where are you running to? -Gale!

544
44:03.305 --> 44:06.585
You guys can joke around nonstop, huh?

545
44:07.425 --> 44:10.745
Only when no one's watching.

546
44:17.625 --> 44:20.785
What's everyone saying online?

547
44:24.905 --> 44:25.865
It's mostly okay,

548
44:27.385 --> 44:29.065
but there are some insulting comments,

549
44:30.065 --> 44:33.265
mostly from Gen X and Gen Y.

550
44:36.705 --> 44:43.025
You know what you did today was basically announcing to the whole school

551
44:43.105 --> 44:45.105
that you're officially one of Toxxxxin, right?

552
44:46.705 --> 44:48.025
I wanted it that way.

553
44:51.745 --> 44:52.905
Seriously?

554
44:53.705 --> 45:00.065
I know that once you've helped me change,

555
45:01.385 --> 45:03.025
we'll probably go our separate ways.

556
45:05.265 --> 45:08.225
But for now,

557
45:08.305 --> 45:12.025
I'd like to stay in Toxxxxin for as long as I can.

558
45:15.945 --> 45:17.025
Can I?

559
45:21.145 --> 45:22.025
Well…

560
45:24.385 --> 45:26.265
If you want to stay,

561
45:27.505 --> 45:28.785
I don't mind.

562
45:29.665 --> 45:30.865
Really?

563
45:31.745 --> 45:34.145
No taking it back, okay?

564
45:34.225 --> 45:35.305
Please?

565
45:35.385 --> 45:36.825
Please, please.

566
45:36.905 --> 45:38.865
Please!

567
45:38.945 --> 45:39.945
Yeah.

568
45:50.785 --> 45:54.385
I'm the one who's unsure.

569
45:56.665 --> 46:01.065
If one day you ever feel unhappy here,

570
46:02.705 --> 46:04.105
let me know.

571
46:12.745 --> 46:13.825
I won't.

572
46:14.665 --> 46:19.705
I know being here might mean facing things I never expected

573
46:20.505 --> 46:23.305
or toxic stuff.

574
46:24.145 --> 46:27.825
But I've made up my mind.

575
46:43.945 --> 46:45.225
I'm staying right here

576
46:47.265 --> 46:49.705
because I really like being here.

577
46:56.145 --> 46:57.705
I really do.

578
47:04.145 --> 47:07.265
Hey! Don't push me!

579
47:08.225 --> 47:10.345
Meimei!

580
47:11.225 --> 47:12.985
Mei! Damn!

581
47:13.065 --> 47:14.945
-What?! You're done for! -Oh, you're dead.

582
47:15.025 --> 47:16.545
Have you ever dived for coins?

583
47:17.785 --> 47:18.705
Yeah.

584
47:19.345 --> 47:21.585
But who carries coins these days?

585
47:22.265 --> 47:23.305
I do.

586
47:24.745 --> 47:26.105
It's a golden one too.

587
47:34.825 --> 47:40.465
Our story may have begun by chance,

588
47:42.025 --> 47:44.265
almost like a dream.

589
47:46.425 --> 47:47.905
Hey! Where is the medal?

590
47:48.945 --> 47:50.305
Found it!

591
47:50.385 --> 47:51.745
Give it to me.

592
47:51.825 --> 47:53.225
Hand it to me!

593
47:53.305 --> 47:57.265
But what matters more is what comes after that coincidence.

594
48:01.105 --> 48:02.505
Give it to me.

595
48:02.585 --> 48:07.505
It could be a good dream, or perhaps a nightmare.

596
48:08.105 --> 48:14.705
Only we can decide whether to stay lost in that dream or wake up.

597
48:15.225 --> 48:16.945
And I've made my choice.

598
48:17.945 --> 48:21.225
Whether it ends up being toxic

599
48:22.065 --> 48:24.065
or the best time of my life,

600
48:24.905 --> 48:28.865
I guess I'll have to take the plunge to find out.

601
48:46.545 --> 48:48.145
-What did you two do? -Hey.

602
48:48.225 --> 48:50.345
-Eh? What? -What did you do?

603
48:50.425 --> 48:52.825
-What did you two do? -Nothing!

604
48:52.905 --> 48:54.865
-I saw it! I did! -We did nothing!

605
48:54.945 --> 48:56.425
-What were you doing? -Nothing.

606
48:56.505 --> 48:57.905
-Nope! -I didn't do anything!

607
48:57.985 --> 48:59.785
-I saw it. -Nope.

608
48:59.865 --> 49:00.785
Yes.

609
49:01.945 --> 49:04.225
We really have to take the plunge

610
49:05.985 --> 49:11.465
to discover what's truly right for us.

611
49:18.145 --> 49:23.905
A modeling agency just called. They want to sign me.

612
49:23.985 --> 49:26.345
Junjai is going to be a professional model!

613
49:26.425 --> 49:30.625
The school doesn't allow students to take modeling jobs.

614
49:30.705 --> 49:32.105
Can't we do anything about this rule?

615
49:32.745 --> 49:34.505
I've figured out what to do!

616
49:34.585 --> 49:36.545
So this isn't weird?

617
49:36.625 --> 49:40.425
Did something happen to you?

618
49:40.505 --> 49:43.705
When we're stressed, it's because the voices in our heads get too loud.

619
49:45.345 --> 49:46.705
